{"title":"Free event. Bello's Birthday Bash w/karaoke @ Owl's Club","startsAt":"2026-11-28T20:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-28T23:30:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"# 🎂🎤 Nick's Birthday Karaoke Bash! 🎤🎂\n\n### Saturday, November 28\n\nIt is my birthday week, so of course I'm looking to celebrate the best way I know how — **with good friends, great music, and karaoke!** 🥳🎶\n\nCome out and help me celebrate at one of Toronto's most unique karaoke spots — the **legendary Owl's Club!**\n\n**IMPORTANT - cash only at this venue.**\n\n📍 **Owl's Club**\n**847 Dovercourt Road, Toronto**\n\nLocated just a short walk from **Ossington Subway Station**, the Owl's Club is a unique venue with a rich and colourful history. It's also become legendary for its **Saturday karaoke nights**, making it the perfect place for a birthday celebration.\n\n### 🎤 KARAOKE!\n\nAs always, **you can sing or just sit back, relax and enjoy the performances.** Whether you're a seasoned karaoke superstar or someone who prefers being part of the audience, everyone is welcome!\nKaraoke usually gets underway around **9:15–9:30 PM** and it can get VERY busy, so if you want to sing, **put your songs in early!** 🎶\n\n### 🎱 More than karaoke!\n\nThere are plenty of other things to do while you're waiting for your turn at the microphone:\n🎯 **Free darts**\n🎱 **Pool table**\n🏒 **Shuffleboard**\n🍻 Drinks & socializing\n🎤 And, of course, lots of karaoke!\n\n### ⏰ When to arrive\n\n**8:30 PM onward**\nNick will be there from around 8:30 PM. Come early, grab a drink, get comfortable and socialize before the karaoke gets rolling.\n**Leaving time:** Whenever you like! Stay for one song or stay until the last singer — totally up to you.\n\n### 🥳 COME HELP ME CELEBRATE!\n\nBirthdays are better with friends, so I'd love to see some familiar faces and meet some new ones too!\nThis isn't just about karaoke — it's about **getting together, meeting people, having some laughs and enjoying a fun Saturday night in Toronto.**\nSingle, partnered, married, new to the group or a longtime member — **everyone is welcome!**\n\n### 📱 Want to hear about more events?\n\nJoin our **WhatsApp group** to stay connected and learn about upcoming events.\n\n**THIS GROUP IS FOR PEOPLE WHO WANT TO BE SOCIAL AND MAKE FRIENDS — WHETHER YOU'RE SINGLE OR NOT SINGLE.**\n\nWe also organize lots of other events, including:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks\n🥾 Hikes\n🎨 Arts & Culture\n🍽️ Restaurants\n🎤 Trivia\n🎉 And plenty more!\n\n### 👍 Not sure if you can make it?\n\n**You can just show up!**\nIf you're not 100% sure about your schedule, don't feel like you have to RSVP and then cancel later. You can simply **show up on the day if you end up being free.**\n\n### 📧 Stay in the loop\n\nDon't forget to join our email list! Meetup does not send emails to everyone in the group, so this is the best way to get our weekly news and hear about upcoming events:\n[http://eepurl.com/hKt76f](http://eepurl.com/hKt76f)\n\n### 👋 Your Organizer\n\n**Nick** is the organizer for this Meetup.\nIf you need to contact him, please post a message on the Meetup wall\n\n🎂 **Come celebrate my birthday, grab the mic (or don't!), and let's make it a great night!** 🎤🥳","venue":{"name":"Owls Club","address":"847 Dovercourt Road, Toronto","lat":43.6638,"lng":-79.42993,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/7/6/2/highres_523578274.jpeg"}